---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ImageCard from '../../components/ImageCard.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<Layout title="Smart Home Automation Case Study" description="Residential smart automation case study covering entertainment, lighting, shading, climate, control and AV integration." canonical="/projects/smart-home" image="/og-image.svg">
  <section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/projects" class="back-link">← Back to Projects</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Residential</span>
      <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);">Oceanview Smart Residence</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">Full smart home automation with entertainment, lighting, shading, and climate control.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="project-hero-img">
        <ImageCard
          key="project-smart-home"
          src="/service-media/home-theater.webp"
          alt="Oceanview Smart Residence — luxury home theater with distributed audio and lighting"
          caption="6,000 sq ft Smart Home"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="project-detail-grid">
        <div class="project-detail-main">
          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>A 6,000 sq ft oceanfront residence requiring a fully integrated smart home system. The homeowners wanted a technology experience that was invisible in the architecture but powerful in capability — everything controlled from a single interface or voice command.</p>

          <h2>Scope</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Whole-home distributed audio (12 zones with in-ceiling and outdoor speakers)</li>
            <li>Dedicated 4K home theater with Dolby Atmos, acoustically transparent screen, and theater seating</li>
            <li>Motorized blackout and solar shades across all windows</li>
            <li>Warm-dimming LED lighting throughout with custom scenes (Morning, Entertain, Movie, Goodnight)</li>
            <li>Multi-zone HVAC control integrated with occupancy sensors</li>
            <li>Intercom and door station with smartphone integration</li>
            <li>Unified control via touch panels, mobile app, and voice (Alexa, Google Assistant)</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Outcome</h2>
          <p>The system has been operational for over two years with zero service calls. The homeowners describe it as "life-changing" — the system anticipates their needs and requires no technical knowledge to operate. Energy savings from automated lighting and shading paid for a significant portion of the investment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="project-detail-side">
          <div class="detail-card glass">
            <h3>Project Details</h3>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Client</span><span>Private Residence</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Location</span><span>Oceanview, CA</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Duration</span><span>4 months</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Budget</span><span>$100K – $500K</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Status</span><span style="color: var(--accent);">Completed</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-card glass">
            <h3>Technologies</h3>
            <div class="tech-tags">
              <span>Control4</span><span>Sonos</span><span>Lutron</span><span>Epson</span><span>Kaleidescape</span><span>Denon</span><span>Roku</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    title="Design Your Smart Home"
    subtitle="Let's create a home that anticipates your every need."
    ctaText="Start Your Project"
    ctaLink="/contact"
  />
</Layout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .project-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .project-hero-img :global(.image-card) {
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;
    border: none;
  }

  .project-detail-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .project-detail-main h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .project-detail-main h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .project-detail-main p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-detail-main ul {
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-detail-main ul li {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .project-detail-main ul li::before {
    content: '›';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .detail-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .detail-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .detail-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .detail-row span:first-child { color: var(--text-tertiary); }

  .detail-row span:last-child {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tech-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .tech-tags span {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .project-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
